ian Fusion","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Middle Eastern","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cajun/Creole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Mediterranean, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","review_id":"jO9mUPqel1hnuW_srYUp-Q","date":"2017-01-09T16:05:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9393249154090881,"text_excerpt":"Schiro's was always my happy place and its reincarnation, Silk Road, is wonderful! It's been completely renovated and updated, while retaining some of Schiro's neighborhoody-rustic charm. Just now, you have tons of wine options, a bar up front, a large communal table and way less groceries (you can still come in to get a six pack in the fridges or wine or hard liquor!) There are a bunch of vegetarian options that the chef will veganize for you (he even came out and asked if my table were all veggie, so there seems to be real care there, which is refreshing). The menu is pan-Asian and although I liked my stir fry enough (it was in need of some serious spice), I have a feeling Indian food i..."},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","review_id":"QQbG4OoVc8jBbDfIVVs2cg","date":"2021-04-17T13:39:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372708797454834,"text_excerpt":"This is a great spot that is truly sort of a hidden gem of Nola. They have a crazy menu with both Creole and Asian (Thai/Indian) foods, so a LOT to choose from. We came and ate on a Friday night with some friends, and they had tables distanced from each other, masks, the whole works in terms of protection, so you can feel confident coming in. As for the food, we ordered a TON of stuff knowing full well we would have leftovers! Also - they have GREAT prices on bottles of wine, which is fantastic. 1. Samosas - these were crispy and really good (also pretty large). 2. Spinach and goat cheese salad - this salad was amazing. The goat cheese was fried and perfect. 3. Lemongrass crab bisque - WO..."},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","review_id":"h6ji8I2Fppnd7XGVwwWnXg","date":"2017-10-27T14:48:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.927302360534668,"text_excerpt":"This place was a great find! There's no shortage of places to try in New Orleans, however when you're looking for something a bit \"different\" you check Yelp and they never lead you down the wrong path. This place is like a magical unicorn. Why, you ask? Well, because they found a way to fuse Indian, Asian and Cajun in one restaurant and it's awesome! Not to mention, there's a bed and breakfast upstairs. I mean, could this place be any better? We arrived right when they opened so we pretty much had the whole place to ourselves. The server was very nice and explained the menu in great detail. The offer Indian \"street food\" and we sampled three of those. I can't remember all the names but I ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","photo_id":"WOQHa-RJjh0bnDK4rDuOxg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WOQHa-RJjh0bnDK4rDuOxg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8686596155166626},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","photo_id":"nrQ5ozHvmvcxwjJs6WIaSw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nrQ5ozHvmvcxwjJs6WIaSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8656631708145142},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","photo_id":"5MYhzgDuQIxePNPS9pbFwA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5MYhzgDuQIxePNPS9pbFwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8484562635421753},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","photo_id":"1HqUrHgvVodsqvUDjPEgxw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1HqUrHgvVodsqvUDjPEgxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8429746627807617},{"business_id":"6fYIlInL937IBuHmocfiBA","photo_id":"EcTA3GezHPojxheKu2Wj9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/EcTA3GezHPojxheKu2Wj9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8412847518920898}]},"notebook_case":null}
